      "sourceTextSha256": "46ddf1b36c7fc427c9aef563a99bb4be2470893fdbe126d6291141c5782feeab",
      "text": "Day 6 · An excursion to the Brazilian side of the falls. A calm walk along the edge of the canyon reveals one of the most spectacular views on Earth, with some 275 cascades and rainbows shimmering in the spray, before the path leads to the largest waterfall in the park, the Devil’s Throat, where the water plunges some 80 metres. A walkway takes you into the heart of the falls, surrounded by their power on all sides, before a stairway leads up to look down on them from above. At the end of the tour, your guide drops you off at your hotel (entrance ticket included).",
